+/*
+ * sys_mremap() entry routing (sec 3.5, D12).  Runs with no locks held
+ * (before do_mremap takes the write lock); prechecks have NOT run yet,
+ * so anything questionable is returned to the legacy funnel for its
+ * documented errno.
